kbuild: backport of the Linux 7.4 build-speed work to 7.3

Single combined diff against vanilla 7.3.1 (stable/linux-7.3.y 79a907609d53).
It carries 33 commits, listed below in application order.

Part 1 (22 commits): changes already merged for 7.4 through the Kbuild /
Kconfig pull request https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20261018035817.GA2365306@ax162/
with the prerequisites they need to apply on 7.3. One conflict in init/Kconfig
(f85147b291e3, against eb13a1ff271b) is resolved the way that pull request
describes: the toolchain block leaves init/Kconfig and eb13a1ff271b is
re-applied to scripts/Kconfig.toolchain.

Part 2 (11 commits): Lorenzo Stoakes's v5 series "kbuild: significantly speed up
kernel builds", posted 2026-11-04 and not merged at the time of writing:
https://patch.msgid.link/20261104-build-speedup-v5-0-0f6018be8dae@kernel.org

Commits (upstream hash, or v5 for part 2):
  - kbuild: Remove alignment on .modinfo section (36d4a11b56aa)
  - kconfig: Add "def_string", "def_int" and "def_hex" (651fb291c4c8)
  - kconfig: Replace "cc-option-bit" with "cc-option-str" (889a621272f9)
  - kconfig: Add "ld-option-str" (cfcc46501881)
  - kbuild: do not allocate .modinfo in vmlinux (5fe4dd596641)
  - kallsyms: index symbols by token to speed up table compression (6f014bf46faf)
  - kallsyms: output binary data to speed output and kallsyms assembly (83da9f3197e5)
  - sorttable: parse nm output correctly (4719513c0fa2)
  - kbuild: do not sort nm output where the order is irrelevant (c2970d8b52d1)
  - kbuild: only emit vmlinux relocations when required (8050568e0a46)
  - elf-parse: add section flags, symbol binding and mapping helpers (5005f8043c09)
  - kallsyms: reimplement mksysmap in C (531980b4b17e)
  - kbuild: move the toolchain checks into scripts/Kconfig.toolchain (f85147b291e3)
  - kbuild: avoid re-running compiler and linker probes (454e00cf8ee5)
  - kbuild: compress the kernel with pigz if available (48ebe1cbbeb5)
  - kbuild: keep .modinfo when vmlinux is linked with --gc-sections (a98db7418797)
  - scripts/Kconfig.toolchain: Drop compiler symbols from dependencies (c4c24fd63a8d)
  - kconfig: Improve ergonomics around disabling warnings with cc-option (7202c08793a2)
  - kbuild: Mark the gzip recipes as recursive (0d4d70da348b)
  - kbuild: Mark the initcall ordering recipe as recursive (ae5f6044c4cd)
  - kbuild: Move testing of '-mfentry' back to Makefile from Kconfig (9a6882502d35)
  - scripts/Kconfig.toolchain: Highlight cc-option differences between Kconfig and Kbuild (e58096244338)
  - kbuild: calculate list, composite object state per object (v5)
  - kbuild: implement and use depcheck to check dependency timestamps (v5)
  - modpost: cache section relocation mismatch state (v5)
  - modpost: emit module descriptors as assembly (v5)
  - kbuild: batch module finalisation (v5)
  - objtool: do not hash DWARF relocations (v5)
  - objtool: cache relocations, do less work, eliminate relocation hash (v5)
  - objtool: size the instruction hash to the text (v5)
  - objtool: decode instructions and resolve branch targets in parallel (v5)
  - rust: make exports.o depend on the headers generated for it (v5)
  - kbuild: build rust crates in parallel with the rest of the build (v5)

